  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grandpa, my Honedge seems like it’s under the\nweather. I even took it to a Pokémon Center, but<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthat didn’t help...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I know what’s happened... Its cutting edge\nhas gotten dull!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000490020006B006E006F00770020007700680061007420190073002000680061007000700065006E00650064002E002E002E0020004900740073002000630075007400740069006E006700200065006400670065000A00680061007300200067006F007400740065006E002000640075006C006C0021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How do I fix it?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F007700200064006F002000490020006600690078002000690074003F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you want to sharpen the Sword Pokémon\nHonedge, there’s only one thing you need...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pupitar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075007000690074006100720021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you mean?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020006D00650061006E003F002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pupitar’s body is incredibly solid—so solid that\nslashing at it will naturally sharpen Honedge’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncutting edge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I dunno about that... And besides, I don’t have a\nPupitar with me...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000640075006E006E006F002000610062006F0075007400200074006800610074002E002E002E00200041006E006400200062006500730069006400650073002C0020004900200064006F006E201900740020006800610076006500200061000A0050007500700069007400610072002000770069007400680020006D0065002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Hey, you! Do you have a Pupitar? Let me battle\nit with my Honedge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Make sure you’ve only got a single Pupitar on\nyour team, then battle my Honedge and me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Slashing at Pupitar’s hard body will sharpen\nHonedge to perfection!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006C0061007300680069006E006700200061007400200050007500700069007400610072201900730020006800610072006400200062006F00640079002000770069006C006C0020007300680061007200700065006E000A0048006F006E006500640067006500200074006F002000700065007200660065006300740069006F006E0021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, you have a Pupitar with you! Do you think\nyou could have it battle my Honedge?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll battle you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200062006100740074006C006500200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, that’s too bad...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000740068006100742019007300200074006F006F0020006200610064002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Great! Let’s do this!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200650061007400210020004C006500742019007300200064006F00200074006800690073002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess that’s an L for us, Honedge. Here, let me\nheal you up.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000670075006500730073002000740068006100742019007300200061006E0020004C00200066006F0072002000750073002C00200048006F006E0065006400670065002E00200048006500720065002C0020006C006500740020006D0065000A006800650061006C00200079006F0075002000750070002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shreeen!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300680072006500650065006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Huh? Honedge seems full of energy again! You\nwere right, Grandpa!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800750068003F00200048006F006E00650064006700650020007300650065006D0073002000660075006C006C0020006F006600200065006E006500720067007900200061006700610069006E002100200059006F0075000A0077006500720065002000720069006700680074002C0020004700720061006E006400700061002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho ho ho! I told you it’d work!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F00200068006F00200068006F00210020004900200074006F006C006400200079006F00750020006900742019006400200077006F0072006B0021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pupitar is the key!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000750070006900740061007200200069007300200074006800650020006B006500790021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But this whole process is good for the Pupitar\ntoo, you know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200074006800690073002000770068006F006C0065002000700072006F006300650073007300200069007300200067006F006F006400200066006F0072002000740068006500200050007500700069007400610072000A0074006F006F002C00200079006F00750020006B006E006F0077002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Testing its durability helps it feel more confident\nand lets it evolve without a worry!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not sure if I believe all that, but...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007300750072006500200069006600200049002000620065006C006900650076006500200061006C006C00200074006800610074002C0020006200750074002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Honedge is back to its old self again! I guess we\nowe Pupitar for that!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks to you and Pupitar for helping me take\ncare of my Honedge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B007300200074006F00200079006F007500200061006E00640020005000750070006900740061007200200066006F0072002000680065006C00700069006E00670020006D0065002000740061006B0065000A00630061007200650020006F00660020006D007900200048006F006E0065006400670065002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sure there are lots of Pokémon that help each\nother out in unexpected ways.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
